# tam-capture-screenrecording-with-webcam — pick a webcam and start a screen
# recording with it (desktop and microphone audio).
#
# Ported from omarchy 4.0.4 (omarchy-capture-screenrecording-with-webcam)
# for plan 18 R4.11. It asks through tam-menu-select when there is more than
# one camera.
